#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Context menu in the Scripts folder"
msgstr "脚本文件夹中的右键菜单"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Separate entry in the context menu"
msgstr "在右键菜单中单独显示"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Only the entries that fit what you selected."
msgstr "只显示与所选内容相符的菜单项。"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Needs the package python3-nautilus: sudo apt install python3-nautilus"
msgstr "需要软件包 python3-nautilus：sudo apt install python3-nautilus"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Name of the entry"
msgstr "菜单项名称"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Turn off the keyboard shortcuts?"
msgstr "要关闭键盘快捷键吗？"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Files binds keys only to entries in the Scripts folder, not to a separate entry, so the keyboard shortcuts of TrustCopy stop working. They come back when you switch to the Scripts folder again."
msgstr "“文件”只能将按键绑定到“脚本”文件夹中的菜单项，而不能绑定到单独的菜单项，因此 TrustCopy 的键盘快捷键将停止工作。切换回“脚本”文件夹后即可恢复。"

#: src/ui_settings.py
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "切换"

